      },
      "message": "fix(ui): keep Post dialog checkboxes clear of the scroll bar\n\nThe Fanuc post gained the Manual Guide i blank row (#3307). With it the\nPost dialog options overflow the scroll area at a 900 px window, egui\nshows its floating vertical scroll bar, and the bar lies over the\nright-aligned checkboxes, so a click on \"Write tool list\" did nothing.\nThe scroll content now keeps a gutter as wide as the bar. The test\nalso pins the new row: listed, off by default, toggles, applies and\nundoes in one step.\n\nRefs #3384\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
