      "message": "test(app): accept only the advisory rings fallback in two Adaptive tests\n\nPR #3108 makes an Adaptive fallback to the Offset rings an advisory\nStrategyFallback warning. blind_slot and corner_relief_safety still\nexpected zero warnings. They now accept only that warning, with the\narea count of the fallback notes, and require that it does not hold\nthe post; all other checks stay.\n\nFixes #3384\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
